      "rid": "doc_1.src_content.1",
      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "P.S. Talking with Father Provincial last Wednesday he said we'd go back to Detroit together. He has been working on the Messenger and I think very probably we will be leaving here shortly - possibly Tuesday or Wednesday. I cannot say just when. God bless you again. Very best regards to V. Bro. Francis and to all our Dear ones.",
